{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52250","headline":"诗（幷序） 十一 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夫妇相对坐，千年亦不足。\n一个病着床，遥看手不[触]（𧢻）\n正报到头来，徒费将钱卜。\n宝物积如山，死得一棺木。\n空手把两拳，口里徒含玉。\n永离台上镜，无心开（一作「关」）衣眠（戴、松尾校作「服」）。\n镜里（戴、项校作「匣」）尘满中，剪刀生衣醭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52250.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52250","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}